				{
					"id": "20C7A9097B1E3166",
					"item": {
						"Count": 1,
						"id": "minecraft:written_book",
						"tag": {
							"author": "Developer",
							"pages": [
								"Congratulations on completing Whiteout Protocol. The main story ends here.",
								"The following is an optional piece of world lore connecting this project to another one of my horror modpacks.",
								"COMPANY ARCHIVE - ENVIRONMENTAL FOLLOW-UP REPORT (EXCERPT). Following the Delta-4 containment incident, long-term environmental monitoring continued throughout the exclusion zone.",
								"Over the following decades, the region underwent significant ecological change. With the disappearance of the prolonged blizzard conditions, annual temperatures gradually increased while remaining consistently cool and humid.",
								"Heavy rainfall, persistent fog and nutrient-rich soil transformed the former frozen landscape into an ideal environment for large conifer growth. Among the first species to establish itself was Sequoia sempervirens.",
								"Within decades, redwood forests spread across the region at an unprecedented rate. As the canopy expanded, sunlight reaching the forest floor decreased dramatically. Native vegetation gradually disappeared, leaving the redwood ecosystem almost entirely dominant.",
								"Environmental recovery was... incomplete. Despite the disappearance of the original winter conditions, biological anomalies originating from the Delta-4 incident persisted.",
								"Long-term observation confirmed continued adaptation among surviving anomalous organisms. Several species demonstrated increased territorial behaviour and successful reproduction within the expanding forest.",
								"Due to the continued presence of anomalous wildlife, the exclusion zone remains under permanent containment. Access restrictions remain in effect. Perimeter monitoring remains active. Public knowledge of the region continues to be suppressed.",
								"Containment measures have proven effective. End of archived document.",
							],
							"resolved": 1,
							"title": "开发者说明",
						},
					},
					"type": "item",
				},
			],
